{
  "title": "NAT Gateway · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "비공개 서버가 외부 서비스를 이용할 때 주소를 변환해 연결합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span> Gateway</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#guide-1\">인터넷으로 나가는 경로</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#guide-2\">가용성과 비용 고려하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>33 / 62</span></div><h1>NAT <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Address Translation)</span> Gateway</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>NAT Gateway는 <strong>비공개 네트워크의 서버가 외부로 연결할 수 있도록 주소를 변환하는 관리형 서비스</strong>입니다. 대표적으로 퍼블릭 IP가 없는 서버가 인터넷에서 업데이트나 외부 API 응답을 받아야 할 때 사용합니다.</p><p>서버가 먼저 시작한 연결의 응답은 받을 수 있지만, 인터넷 사용자가 NAT를 통해 내부 서버로 새 연결을 시작할 수는 없습니다. 이런 연결 방식을 주소 변환<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>으로 구현합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"public-nat-gateway\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"private-nat-gateway\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"zonal-nat-gateway\"></span><h2>인터넷으로 나가는 경로</h2><p>일반적인 퍼블릭 NAT 구성에서는 비공개 서브넷의 인터넷행 경로를 NAT Gateway로 지정합니다. NAT Gateway는 인터넷 게이트웨이를 통한 경로와 퍼블릭 주소를 사용해 요청을 전달합니다.</p><p>Private NAT Gateway는 사내망이나 다른 비공개 네트워크와 통신할 때 주소를 변환하는 용도로 사용합니다. 인터넷 접속 목적이라면 퍼블릭 NAT 구성을 선택합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"regional-nat-gateway\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"dns64-and-nat64\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"nat-instance\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cost-and-service-endpoints\"></span><h2>가용성과 비용 고려하기</h2><p>AZ별 NAT Gateway를 사용하는 구성에서는 각 AZ의 서버가 같은 AZ의 NAT를 이용하도록 경로를 설계합니다. 이렇게 하면 다른 AZ의 장애에 의존하는 구간을 줄일 수 있습니다.</p><p>NAT의 운영 시간과 처리한 데이터에 따른 비용을 고려합니다. S3와 DynamoDB 접근은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">게이트웨이 엔드포인트</a>를 사용하면 인터넷 NAT 경로를 거치지 않게 구성할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>비공개 서버의 인터넷 요청</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>비공개 서버</strong><span>내부에서 요청 시작</span></li><li><strong>NAT Gateway</strong><span>출발지 주소 변환</span></li><li><strong>인터넷 서비스</strong><span>요청에 대한 응답</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">응답은 NAT가 기억한 연결 정보를 따라 원래 서버로 돌아옵니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>비공개 서브넷의 주문 처리 서버가 외부 결제 API를 호출합니다. 서버를 인터넷에 직접 공개하지 않고 NAT를 통해 필요한 외부 요청을 보냅니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>주소 변환</strong> — 패킷의 IP 주소와 포트 정보를 바꾸어 다른 네트워크와 통신하게 하는 방식입니다. NAT는 연결 정보를 기억해 응답을 원래 요청자에게 돌려보냅니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/vpc-nat-gateway.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NAT gateways ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/nat-gateways-regional.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Regional NAT gateways for automatic multi-AZ expansion ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q010/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q010\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q010\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q010</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q010/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs outbound IPv4 access to an internet package repository. What is a typical design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A NAT gateway in a public subnet and a route from the private subnet to it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach an internet gateway directly to the private subnet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy only CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a Route 53 failover policy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · 퍼블릭 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>를 통해 외부 연결을 시작하고 응답받는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q011\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q011\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q011</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q011/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application runs in two Availability Zones and uses zonal public NAT gateways. If one AZ fails, workloads in the surviving AZ must retain outbound internet access. Which NAT design should the architect use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Add only a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a single NAT gateway in AZ A</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy a NAT gateway in each AZ and route each subnet to its local NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q011\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach one Elastic IP to both AZs simultaneously</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>와 경로는 단일 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a> 의존을 제거하고 교차 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 트래픽도 줄인다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q017\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q017\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q017</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A private EC2 instance needs access to S3 without routing S3 traffic through a NAT gateway. What is usually the simplest choice?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A public Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">라우트 테이블</a>을 통해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 사설 경로를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q081\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q081\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q081</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q081/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to analyze whether NAT gateways or data transfer caused a cost increase over time. Which tool is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q081\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q081\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q081\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Cost Explorer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q081\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">SQS visibility timeout</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/#aws-cost-explorer\">Cost Explorer</a>로 서비스와 기간별 비용 추세를 분석한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,3\" data-question=\"Q083\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q083\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q083</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q083/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs to access only S3. Which TWO components reduce NAT usage and internet exposure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Configure the subnet's route table</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an Elastic IP address to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Require a default route to an internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Create an S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow inbound access from 0.0.0.0/0</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, D</strong> · 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 적절한 라우트 연결을 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 접근에 공인 주소나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>가 필수는 아니다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">이전 용어 <b>Lambda</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">다음 용어 <b>Network ACL</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
